        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FxGGdTaZdowf49xbwohlB2jdgpf\"><em><strong>The pie charts below show the percentage of five kinds of books sold by a bookseller between 1972 and 2012. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Book Sales by Category: 1972&ndash;2012</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rr69dUPWloIGSsxBNgSl8jALgNc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-pie-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Pie Charts</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sz7Ddn0UQoQ3DNxxU5glUUAygrd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Book Sales by Category: 1972&ndash;2012 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả phần trăm của năm loại s&aacute;ch được b&aacute;n ra ở một tiệm s&aacute;ch từ năm 1972 đến 2012</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XE5cdjVTzoI0psxsI43lZfJwgjd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D3RNdV9QooV4S7x7vHllvMpRgpg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Book Sales by Category: 1972&ndash;2012 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: phần trăm 5 loại s&aacute;ch - một tiệm s&aacute;ch - từ 1972 đến 2012.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NsL7dQJRioarz1xcz5blgYQygte\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Pie Charts</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-pie\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng Pie</span></a></strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OSqAd7ovwoy8phxc0sulhAq1gif\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OSqAd7ovwoy8phxc0sulhAq1gif\">&nbsp;</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vo89d14hOonsMkxyYf5lR3uegph\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>adult fiction v&agrave; children's fiction c&oacute; xu hướng tăng, trong khi biography, travel, v&agrave; others c&oacute; xu hướng giảm</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D56cdlYjwoBPqAx3RbZltux8gah\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>adult fiction chiếm lĩnh thị trường ở năm 2012, chiếm gần nửa số s&aacute;ch b&aacute;n ra</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDEMd2TadoWZ8SxhKAElWam3guf\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R3mAdOPraoIntixj74Hl77aWg4c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Nh&oacute;m s&aacute;ch adult fiction v&agrave; children's fiction</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YSc9dWUH7ocpH5xBmI1lzLovg3e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfjUdbIj8oHoivxVEGel2Kroguf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1972 </strong><em>(cả adult fiction v&agrave; children's fiction, mỗi thể loại chiếm 20% doanh số)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V9UMdvnmxoQKkqxtVKIlMCk1g9d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của adult fiction </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng đều</strong></em><em> đạt 25% v&agrave;o 1992 v&agrave; </em><em><strong>tăng mạnh</strong></em><em> đạt 45% v&agrave;o năm 2012)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BIerdEzkIo9gdWxPQIjlgUUKgqf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của children fiction </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng nhẹ</strong></em><em><strong> </strong></em><em>đạt 22% v&agrave;o 1992 trước khi </em><em><strong>giữ ổn định</strong></em><em> ở mức 25% v&agrave;o năm 2012)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0uDdZcYWoG1zexrLt3lJdQCgEf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WCPzdeRAgoUes4xFpDtljjIBgGY\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Nh&oacute;m s&aacute;ch biography, travel, v&agrave; others</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EFETdmGYgoOLmBx8tnvl1yWSgcT\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V8rTdwTsjo9yZ1xvXfjlyekNgwx\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1972 </strong><em>(biography chiếm 20% doanh số, travel chiếm 15% v&agrave; others chiếm 25%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LGRzd60lioXBMmxcvEyl4BsUg9e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của biography </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>giảm dần</strong></em><em> đạt 15% v&agrave;o 1992 v&agrave; </em><em><strong>giảm s&acirc;u</strong></em><em> đạt 8% v&agrave;o năm 2012)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DzUddz4tmosAG4xHX7OlHoEAgfc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của travel </strong><em>(tăng đạt 18% v&agrave;o 1992 trước khi giảm xuống 10% v&agrave;o năm 2012)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XL6MdJlIfoOgvux6rEvl26hDgUV\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của others </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>giảm đều</strong></em><em> kết th&uacute;c ở mức 12% v&agrave;o năm 2012)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0uDdZcYWoG1zexrLt3lJdQCgEf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0uDdZcYWoG1zexrLt3lJdQCgEf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasin</strong><strong>g</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZWtJdJPxUoB4qCxtQPil2P6Hg6g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Đ&acirc;y đều l&agrave; c&aacute;c thể loại s&aacute;ch n&ecirc;n m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng từ <strong>\"category\"</strong> để trỏ đến ch&uacute;ng xuy&ecirc;n suốt b&agrave;i, thay v&igrave; viết <strong>\"adult fiction and children's fiction\"</strong>, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"both fiction categories\"</strong> để chỉ <strong>\"hai thể loại s&aacute;ch viễn tưởng\" </strong>để c&acirc;u văn đa dạng hơn nh&eacute;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RDZldRRzaoKJFHx9g0NlEyL4gFc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MLZLdtdDtom4DPxoTiBlfslJgQg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Both <strong>fiction categories</strong> showed upward trends over the 40-year period.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 423,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TP2jdPkRVoaQkCxl65fl6ekJgbc\">The pie charts illustrate the proportions of five different book categories sold by a bookseller between 1972 and 2012.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13793,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 424,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AEEFdz7HMo83Cdx3YbtlfxETgJc\">Overall, both fiction categories showed upward trends over the 40-year period, while biography, travel, and other types of books declined. In addition, adult fiction dominated the market by 2012, accounting for nearly half of all books sold.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13793,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 425,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgRjdnE5hodYfJxY12Slz1wZgle\">Looking at the two main fiction categories, adult fiction and children's fiction each represented 20% of total sales in 1972. While adult fiction's share rose steadily to 25% in 1992 and then surged to 45% by 2012, children's fiction showed only a slight increase to 22% in 1992 before maintaining a relatively stable share of 25% in the final year.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13793,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 426,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A27qdNyDDoLMmxxVWaRlUFlwgEd\">Regarding the remaining categories, biography also made up 20% of sales in 1972, followed by travel at 15% and other types at 25%. Biography's proportion declined gradually to 15% and then dropped further to just 8% by 2012. Meanwhile, travel books showed some fluctuation, rising slightly to 18% in 1992 before falling to 10% in 2012, while the share of other books decreased consistently, ending at 12% in the final year.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13793,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
